@startuml diag-flux-phase5

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false

title Phase 5 — Rotation Automatique des Certificats

participant "Dispositif IoT" as DEV
participant "HashiCorp\nVault (PKI)" as VAULT

note over DEV, VAULT
  Avant expiration du TTL (24h),
  le dispositif renouvelle son certificat
  automatiquement via l'API Vault.
end note

DEV -> VAULT : Renouvellement certificat\n(nouveau CSR)
VAULT --> DEV : Nouveau certificat X.509\n(TTL = 24h)

@enduml
